# Benchmark: json
# Workload: 60 round trips of an object through JSON text - convert to json,
# then parse it back and read fields. Measures JSON encode and decode.

person has name "Jeff", age 40, city "Sydney"
checksum is 0
count from 1 to 60 as n
    convert person to json into jsonText
    convert jsonText from json into rebuilt
    checksum is checksum plus age of rebuilt
.
say "json" checksum
